# =============================================================================
# GC OutOfMemoryError Tests
# =============================================================================
# Runs allocation failures against a heap with a hard upper bound to check that
# they are reported as OutOfMemoryError instead of aborting the process, that
# the GC reserve leaves room to record the stack of the failed allocation, and
# that concurrent failures share the preallocated fallback error.

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Phase 1: Run with Immix GC
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
> set nativeConfig ~= { _.withGC(scala.scalanative.build.GC.immix) }
> runHeapExhaustion

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Phase 2: Run with Commix GC
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
> set nativeConfig ~= { _.withGC(scala.scalanative.build.GC.commix) }
> runHeapExhaustion
